  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WOLA &#x2013; Supporting Colombia Peace, a Solution to the Venezuela Crisis, and Cuba Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support the implementation of the peace agreement in Colombia, contribute to a negotiated solution to the crisis in Venezuela, and prevent tension and resolve conflict in the relation between the U.S. and Cuba.</narrative>
